<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <MX_QH_AssembleLostMusicScore.label>拼合清荷曲谱</MX_QH_AssembleLostMusicScore.label>
  <MX_QH_AssembleLostMusicScore.description>将失传的曲谱残片拼合成书卷。90%概率得到随机清荷技能书，否则得到普通书。技能书有15%概率额外记录第二个不同技能。</MX_QH_AssembleLostMusicScore.description>
  <MX_QH_AssembleLostMusicScore.jobString>正在拼合清荷曲谱。</MX_QH_AssembleLostMusicScore.jobString>
  <MX_QH_WriteLotusRainPavilionOpera.label>撰写荷雨亭曲艺</MX_QH_WriteLotusRainPavilionOpera.label>
  <MX_QH_WriteLotusRainPavilionOpera.description>由清荷将荷雨亭中的花影、水声与曲调写成书卷。25%概率写成随机清荷技能书，否则写成《荷雨亭曲艺》。技能书有15%概率额外记录第二个不同技能。</MX_QH_WriteLotusRainPavilionOpera.description>
  <MX_QH_WriteLotusRainPavilionOpera.jobString>正在撰写荷雨亭曲艺。</MX_QH_WriteLotusRainPavilionOpera.jobString>
  <MX_QH_WriteLotusRainPavilionOpera.modExtensions.1.variants.0.title>荷雨亭曲艺：春水调</MX_QH_WriteLotusRainPavilionOpera.modExtensions.1.variants.0.title>
  <MX_QH_WriteLotusRainPavilionOpera.modExtensions.1.variants.0.content>清荷记下荷雨初歇时的水声与轻拍。读到此卷时，仿佛能听见春水漫过石阶，细碎花影随声摇动。</MX_QH_WriteLotusRainPavilionOpera.modExtensions.1.variants.0.content>
  <MX_QH_WriteLotusRainPavilionOpera.modExtensions.1.variants.1.title>荷雨亭曲艺：花影记</MX_QH_WriteLotusRainPavilionOpera.modExtensions.1.variants.1.title>
  <MX_QH_WriteLotusRainPavilionOpera.modExtensions.1.variants.1.content>这卷手稿写的是花影、步法与短曲之间的呼应。句子不求铺张，却处处留下清荷对庭中草木的细致观察。</MX_QH_WriteLotusRainPavilionOpera.modExtensions.1.variants.1.content>
  <MX_QH_WriteLotusRainPavilionOpera.modExtensions.1.variants.2.title>荷雨亭曲艺：听雨小谱</MX_QH_WriteLotusRainPavilionOpera.modExtensions.1.variants.2.title>
  <MX_QH_WriteLotusRainPavilionOpera.modExtensions.1.variants.2.content>清荷把雨落荷叶的节拍拆成数段短谱，又在页边附上演奏时的心得。文字安静，读来却有微雨入亭的回响。</MX_QH_WriteLotusRainPavilionOpera.modExtensions.1.variants.2.content>
  <MX_QH_WriteLotusRainPavilionOpera.modExtensions.1.variants.3.title>荷雨亭曲艺：莲步散声</MX_QH_WriteLotusRainPavilionOpera.modExtensions.1.variants.3.title>
  <MX_QH_WriteLotusRainPavilionOpera.modExtensions.1.variants.3.content>这是一篇兼记舞步与曲调的书卷。清荷以很轻的笔触描摹衣袂、铃音和水面涟漪，使寻常曲艺多了几分雅致。</MX_QH_WriteLotusRainPavilionOpera.modExtensions.1.variants.3.content>
  <MX_QH_WriteLotusRainPavilionOpera.modExtensions.1.variants.4.title>荷雨亭曲艺：羽衣听荷</MX_QH_WriteLotusRainPavilionOpera.modExtensions.1.variants.4.title>
  <MX_QH_WriteLotusRainPavilionOpera.modExtensions.1.variants.4.content>清荷把荷雨亭中的水声写成底韵，又在页边记下霓羽起势时衣袂掠风的轻响。整卷读来像一场隔水相和的短曲。</MX_QH_WriteLotusRainPavilionOpera.modExtensions.1.variants.4.content>
  <MX_QH_WriteLotusRainPavilionOpera.modExtensions.1.variants.5.title>荷雨亭曲艺：离火照雨</MX_QH_WriteLotusRainPavilionOpera.modExtensions.1.variants.5.title>
  <MX_QH_WriteLotusRainPavilionOpera.modExtensions.1.variants.5.content>这卷手稿写雨夜灯火与弦声相映。清荷将昭离谈及的余烬、命火与回声化作曲中转折，使荷亭旧调多了一分明亮锋芒。</MX_QH_WriteLotusRainPavilionOpera.modExtensions.1.variants.5.content>
</LanguageData>
